course: dictionary
lesson: 4174
title: Word meanings: godfather
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. Use the words around it, the context, to find out which meaning fits. «Uncle Tom is my godfather.» Here the words my and Uncle tell you it is about family, so godfather means a special person in your family.
explain: Church is another clue. A godfather makes a promise at a baptism or christening. He promises to help bring the child up in the Christian faith and to care for them. The church meaning is about a promise, not about blood.
explain: Listen for words like rock or film. «She is the godfather of rock» means she is the early founder, the most important person who started rock music. «The Godfather» is a film, and in that story a godfather is the boss of a criminal gang.
explain: Always test your meaning. Swap it into the sentence: does «My uncle Tom is my boss of a gang» make sense? No. Does «My uncle Tom is my special family helper at church» make sense? Yes. That is the meaning you want.
fact: A godfather is a man who promises at a child's baptism or christening to help bring the child up in the Christian faith.
fact: A godfather also cares for the child, and godparents are treated almost as family.
fact: «The godfather of rock» means the founder or most important early person of rock music.
fact: Informal «godfather» can mean the boss of a criminal gang, from the film «The Godfather».
fact: In Russian, khreshchEnyi and khreshchEna mean godfather and godmother.
exercise: «Uncle Tom is my godfather.» What does godfather mean here? | My teacher at school | *A man who promised, at my christening, to help bring me up and care for me | The boss of a criminal gang | A man who sells cars
exercise: Sam says «She is the godfather of rock.» What does it mean? | The boss who fires the drummer | *The early founder, the most important person who started rock music | The lead singer of a band | A player who knows every instrument
exercise: «Godparents are treated almost as family.» Find and copy the word that means nearly. | family | *almost | treated | godparents
test: In the film «The Godfather», what does godfather mean? | A teacher at a school | *The boss of a criminal gang | A man who brings up children in church | A father who is very old
test: Which meaning of godfather is about church? | A man who runs a shop | The boss of a gang | The founder of rock music | *A man who promises at a christening to help bring up the child in the faith
exam: «At the christening, my godfather promised to care for me.» What does godfather mean in this sentence? | The founder of a famous band | *A man who promised to help bring me up in the Christian faith | The leader of a criminal gang | A brave soldier
